# crop (optional, off by default) = GRAVITY:WIDTHxHEIGHT   gravity: north, center, northeast, northwest, south...
#   e.g. north:70%x60%  keeps the top-centre 70% wide × 60% tall
#
# Commons search ideas for the classic view are in the comments on the right.

